#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:1 77c74f3df1294d71b9cca425f4421077
msgid "Make Dataset"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:3 58b0f97c527b4fb2abddc9df0569d8eb
msgid ""
"`Make Dataset` 是候选训练结构的生产台。它把“扩胞、应变、扰动、缺陷、表面、掺杂、磁性设置” "
"这些操作拆成卡片，让你把一批可信初始结构扩展成候选池。"
msgstr ""
"`Make Dataset` is the workspace for producing candidate training structures."
" It represents supercells, strain, perturbations, defects, surfaces, doping,"
" and magnetic initialization as cards that expand trusted starting "
"structures into a candidate pool."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:6 8c113388eb3249f1880eede3908188cc
msgid "它的输出通常还不是最终训练集。更稳的路线是："
msgstr ""
"Its output is normally not a finished training set. Use the following "
"workflow:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:8 d0aa59d22e9c407aae89613b4563fe76
msgid ""
"导入初始结构\n"
"-> 用卡片生成候选结构\n"
"-> 导出候选池\n"
"-> 在 NEP Dataset Display 里清洗异常结构\n"
"-> 采样后送去 DFT\n"
msgstr ""
"Import starting structures\n"
"-> Generate candidates with cards\n"
"-> Export the candidate pool\n"
"-> Remove anomalous structures in NEP Dataset Display\n"
"-> Sample representative structures and send them to DFT\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:16 6266c350edb54cf7812fd68dd567defa
msgid "Make Dataset workspace"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:16 6266c350edb54cf7812fd68dd567defa
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:21 510b7fc1f32842de9468ababd510fd9d
msgid "基本操作顺序"
msgstr "Basic workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:23 965fee270126463b8c86e9ad944a98e6
msgid "用顶部 `Open` 导入初始结构。"
msgstr "Use `Open` in the top toolbar to import the starting structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:24 aed51ccea2b14ced9e47e5753f171160
msgid "点击 `Add new card` 添加生成或筛选卡片。"
msgstr "Click `Add new card` and choose a generation or filtering card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:25 4a28cf4e8e1f4a4c83765cf4e7e63e25
msgid "展开卡片，只设置与当前物理目标直接相关的参数。"
msgstr ""
"Expand the card and set only the parameters required by the current physical"
" objective."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:26 3b7a90f4201b42ed8ce0d212544f21a7
msgid "勾选要运行的卡片。"
msgstr "Enable the cards that should run."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:27 d951a71457e44897bfb3c0c36868a364
msgid "点击 `Run`。"
msgstr "Click `Run`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:28 09339781a4354f2599bf3207c85d7dba
msgid "在卡片上检查输出数量并导出结果。"
msgstr "Check the output count on each card, then export the result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:30 c92f4b12031b45279c8f5661f5bdcda6
msgid "不要跳过第一步。多数卡片需要已有结构作为输入；如果你想从晶体原型从零生成结构， 应该使用对应的生成型卡片，并单独检查输出是否符合材料体系。"
msgstr ""
"Do not skip the import step. Most cards require existing structures as "
"input. To generate from a crystal prototype without input structures, use "
"the appropriate generator card and independently verify that its outputs "
"belong to the intended material system."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:33 880a8b7daa0c4f23b99f6306d30d99a9
msgid "卡片怎么串"
msgstr "Connect cards into a workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:35 2834dcada5324dbc9fa8e3a10ccc424b
msgid "最常见的是线性链："
msgstr "The most common arrangement is a linear chain:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:37 6f3506e17b2c496087d1ea261f75055e
msgid "Super Cell → Lattice Strain → Atomic Perturb\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:41 8f50c89a9d4d4006898b347cfc0d62ca
msgid "每张卡会处理上一张卡的输出。一般原则是："
msgstr "Each card processes the output of the preceding card. As a rule:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:43 a4f47ae0d0704316ac8166d0031ece1c
msgid "先改晶胞，再改原子坐标。"
msgstr "Modify the cell before modifying atomic coordinates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:44 a1815c184fe74ce2aed133ab6f6f1765
msgid "先做确定性结构变换，再做随机扰动。"
msgstr "Apply deterministic transformations before random perturbations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:45 ce3b4fa1036641ea9486cdfa8a3c2795
msgid "先生成候选池，再做清洗和采样。"
msgstr "Generate the candidate pool before cleaning and sampling it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:47 fdc3d7b5f1144c7b97668977f64b72e4
msgid "如果同一个输入结构要走多条分支，例如一支做表面、一支做空位，可以用 `Card Group`。 组内卡片共享同一输入，输出再汇总。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Card Group` when the same input should follow several branches, for "
"example one surface branch and one vacancy branch. Cards in the group share "
"the input and their outputs are merged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:50 f984587ed8c34f3da86dfb05da4728ae
msgid "第一次选哪张卡"
msgstr "Choose a first card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:16 370615e96b884853b1372c5ecc0e9972
