#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:64 a8dee12d391d4ef498a6140afff78adf
msgid "完整选择表见 [Make Dataset 卡片手册](make-dataset-cards/index.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See the [Make Dataset card manual](make-dataset-cards/index.md) for the "
"complete selection table."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:66 87519ab11c1e4138bb6651afe1a6142d
msgid "什么时候导出"
msgstr "When to export intermediate results"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:68 b12201a8551b4f56943075eaeaa17ead
msgid "每张卡运行后都应该先看输出数量。数量符合预期，再导出为中间文件，例如："
msgstr ""
"Check the output count after every card runs. If it matches the intended "
"combinatorics, export an intermediate file such as:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:70 17daa6746fba4530bbf3a90de4c771d5
msgid ""
"candidate_pool.xyz\n"
"candidate_pool_clean.xyz\n"
"candidate_pool_fps.xyz\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:76 031160618fdb49dfa13ad89b967b8647
msgid "这样后续发现问题时，可以追溯到底是生成阶段、清洗阶段还是采样阶段引入的。"
msgstr ""
"These stage-specific files make it possible to trace a later problem to "
"generation, cleaning, or sampling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:78 e8019619900042659d4ec52d20420105
msgid "FPS Filter 放在哪里"
msgstr "Where to place FPS Filter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:80 0ce259f886d64675910e12ea4e33af2f
msgid "`FPS Filter` 适合在候选结构已经基本干净后做代表性采样。它不负责判断结构是否物理合理。"
msgstr ""
"Use `FPS Filter` for representative sampling after the candidate structures "
"are reasonably clean. It does not determine whether a structure is "
"physically sensible."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:82 a10ddd4c61cf4cb9bb8d7e3551dd5883
msgid ""
"如果候选池来自强扰动、随机缺陷、表面切片或随机占位，建议先导出候选结构， 到 `NEP Dataset Display` 里清洗，再回来或继续使用 "
"`FPS Filter` 采样。"
msgstr ""
"When a candidate pool comes from strong perturbations, random defects, "
"surface cutting, or random occupation, export and clean it in `NEP Dataset "
"Display` before applying `FPS Filter`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:85 89a1cebd266646c4914ab1699df2fb02
msgid "完整流程见 [候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT](../workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Clean candidate structures before DFT](../workflows/clean-candidate-"
"structures.md) for the complete workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:87 d3d147b490544b10a150bb17a2d1cfc5
msgid "保存和恢复工作区"
msgstr "Save and restore a workspace"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:89 410b7a1109534a558f3c9c3ec6d115f9
msgid ""
"顶部 `Save` / `Load` 会把当前工作区的卡片顺序、参数和启停状态保存成 JSON。 "
"这适合保存一条可复用的生成方案，例如“某个合金体系的缺陷候选池生成流程”。"
msgstr ""
"`Save` and `Load` in the top toolbar store the card order, parameters, and "
"enabled state as JSON. Use this to preserve a reusable generation recipe, "
"such as a defect-candidate workflow for a particular alloy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:92 6b6c9fd8fb084d8d8627b9fd7836dcf1
msgid "保存工作区不等于保存生成结构。结构结果仍需要从卡片导出。"
msgstr ""
"Saving the workspace does not save generated structures. Export structure "
"results from their card separately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:94 515c9820dc4745a5939d0b672a971b52
msgid "文档入口"
msgstr "Related documentation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:96 477de078f8424fa1bad4676af17ac9e3
msgid "[快速开始](../quickstart.md)：从安装到生成第一批候选结构。"
msgstr ""
"[Quickstart](../quickstart.md): install NepTrainKit and generate a first "
"candidate set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:97 e9345d5cb9b4470980802c94cf38be1c
msgid "[卡片手册](make-dataset-cards/index.md)：按目标选卡、易混卡片对比、每张卡的完整参数说明。"
msgstr ""
"[Card manual](make-dataset-cards/index.md): choose cards by objective, "
"compare similar cards, and read complete parameter references."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:98 5815d4ade8844cb2bf1bcf6a76acff41
msgid "[配方示例](make-dataset-cards/recipes.md)：多卡组合示例。"
msgstr ""
"[Workflow recipes](make-dataset-cards/recipes.md): examples that combine "
"several cards."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:99 8e51e4f8eab64522a08368358602bc32
msgid "[自定义卡片开发](custom-card-development.md)：把已有脚本封装成 Make Dataset 卡片。"
msgstr ""
"[Custom card development](custom-card-development.md): package an existing "
"script as a Make Dataset card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:101 b2bda6eb44bf4f77b452e791f233fb4e
msgid "从文档 JSON 直接创建卡片"
msgstr "Create cards directly from documentation JSON"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:103 7e9f5d61faef46e484adfb34142d20e6
msgid ""
"如果文档里给出的是单张卡片 JSON、卡片数组，或者完整的 `card_config.json`，可以先复制代码块，再回到 `Make Dataset`"
" 页面执行 `Load → Paste Card JSON`。"
msgstr ""
"When the documentation provides one card object, an array of cards, or a "
"complete `card_config.json`, copy the code block, return to `Make Dataset`, "
"and choose `Load → Paste Card JSON`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset.md:105 8dbfa48cccb94ed684d9c26ac27aff40
msgid ""
"这个入口不会清空当前工作区，只会把剪贴板里的卡片追加到末尾。需要完整替换工作区时，仍然使用 `Load → Import Card Config` "
"导入保存好的 JSON 文件。"
msgstr ""
"This action appends the clipboard cards and does not clear the current "
"workspace. To replace the entire workspace, use `Load → Import Card Config` "
"and select a saved JSON file."
